<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - LIQUIDITY STEADY AT BELGIAN MONEY TENDER.</title>
<headline>TABLE - LIQUIDITY STEADY AT BELGIAN MONEY TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank gave the following details on its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances -</p>
<p>    Value date 13/08	  expiry on 20/08</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	     7.000 bln bfr    (7.025 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate		 3.00 pct	   (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    150.625 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  4.50</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on August 13</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on August 4</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
